{"articleNo":"3089","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=view&articleNo=3089&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"재입학 계획(2012학년도 1학기)","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2012.01.03","hit":"9140","attachments":[{"name":"재입학여석표.hwp","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=download&articleNo=3089&attachNo=1591"},{"name":"재입학원서.hwp","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=download&articleNo=3089&attachNo=2584"}],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<!--StartFragment-->&nbsp;\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 20pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼엑스포&quot;; TEXT-DECORATION: underline\">2012학년도 1학기 재입학 안내</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 6pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;HY목각파임B&quot;; TEXT-DECORATION: underline\"><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; TEXT-ALIGN: left\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;\">1. 재입학 대상 </span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;\">&nbsp; </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;\">&nbsp;재학 중 자퇴, 미등록 ․ 미복학 및 학사경고 누적 등의 사유로 제적된 자.</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;\"><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;\">2. 재입학 자격 제한</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 41pt; TEXT-INDENT: -41pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: 0.3pt\">&nbsp; </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: 0.3pt\"></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: 0.9pt\">가. 학</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: -1.2pt\">부(과)의 재입학 심사에서 학생활동 등으로 제적된 자 중 개전의 정</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: 0.9pt\">이 없는 자로</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: 0.6pt\"> 인정된 경우.</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;나. 학사경고로 제적된 후 1년(2학기)이 경과되지 아니한 자.</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;다. 수학능력과 수업태도 등 학업활동을 계속할 수 없다고 판단되는 자.</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;라. 재입학 사실이 있는 자(재입학은 1회에 한함)</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;\">&nbsp; </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: 0.5pt\">&nbsp;마. 징계에 의하여 제적된 자 및 재학연한초과자(재학연한은 12학기, 건축학전공은 14학기)</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;\"><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;\">3. 재입학 신청 일정(여석표는 첨부물 참조)</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;\">가. </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;\">재입학원서 접수기간 : </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;; TEXT-DECORATION: underline\">2012. 1. 10(화) ~ 1. 12(목)</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;☞ 재입학 신청 장소 :</span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;\"> 해당“종합학사행정실”</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;나. 재입학 허가일 : </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;; TEXT-DECORATION: underline\">2012. 2. 8(수)</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;※ 합격자 조회는 “</span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-STYLE: italic; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;\">원스톱서비스-학적부-학적자료조회”메뉴 </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;\">에서 확인 가능</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;\">(학적자료메뉴에서 학적상태를 </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;\">재학생</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;\">으로 확인)</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 40.4pt; TEXT-INDENT: -40.4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;※ 재입학 합격자 중 휴학 신청을 원하는 학생은 등록을 완료하고 2012. 3. 2(금) 개강 이후 가능</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 2pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; MARGIN-RIGHT: 2pt; TEXT-ALIGN: left\"><span style=\"COLOR: #282828; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: 0.9pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\"COLOR: #282828; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;\">다. 수강신청 기간 </span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 2pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; MARGIN-RIGHT: 2pt; TEXT-ALIGN: left\"><span style=\"COLOR: #282828; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;2012. 2. 14(화) ~ 2. 15(수) 1학년, 4학년이상</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 2pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; MARGIN-RIGHT: 2pt; TEXT-ALIGN: left\"><span style=\"COLOR: #282828; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;2012. 2. 16(목) ~ 2. 17(금) 2학년, 3학년</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 2pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; MARGIN-RIGHT: 2pt; TEXT-ALIGN: left\"><span style=\"COLOR: #282828; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\"COLOR: #282828; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;\">라. 등록 기간 : </span><span style=\"COLOR: #282828; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;\">2012. 2. 21(화) ~ 24(금)</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;\"><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;\">4. 재입학 구비서류 양식</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;\"> :&nbsp;첨부물 참조</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;\">가. 재입학 원서 1부(다운로드 가능)</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;나. 학적부 사본 및 성적증명서 각 1부</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;다. 학생 자필로 된 각서 및 학부장 추천서 각 1부(다운로드 가능)</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;\"><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;\">5. 기타사항</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;\"></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;가. 재입학은 여석이 있는 경우에 한하여 허가함(학사운영규정에 의거)</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;나. 재입학은 제적 당시의 동일학년 이하의 학년에 한하여 허가함.</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;☞ 제적 당시의 학부(과, 전공)로만 재입학이 가능함 </span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;다. 재입학자가 기 취득한 학점 및 성적은 그대로 인정함.</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 42.2pt; TEXT-INDENT: -42.2pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;라. 재입학 이전에 받은 학사경고와 휴학기간은 재입학 이후에 통산하지 아니함.</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 38.6pt; TEXT-INDENT: -38.6pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: 0.2pt\">마. 재</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: 0.3pt\">입학이 허가된 자는 소정의 기일 내에 입학금 및 기타 납입금의 납부 등 학적 </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: 0.2pt\">절차를 이행하여야</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;\">하며, 미등록시 제적 처리함.</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 38.6pt; TEXT-INDENT: -38.6pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;바.</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: 0.1pt\"> </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; COLOR: #ff0000; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: 0.1pt\">공학계열 재입학시 공학교육인증과정 </span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 38.6pt; TEXT-INDENT: -38.6pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: 0.1pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;① 2005학년도 이전 입학자 : 공학교육비인증과정</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 38.6pt; TEXT-INDENT: -38.6pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: 0.1pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;② 2006학년도 이후 입학자</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 38.6pt; TEXT-INDENT: -38.6pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: 0.1pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;- 4개학기이내 : 공학교육인증과정</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 38.6pt; TEXT-INDENT: -38.6pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: 0.1pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;- 5개학기이상 : 공학교육비인증과정</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 38.6pt; TEXT-INDENT: -38.6pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: 0.1pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;※ 전입한 학기 이내 및 4학기 이내로 재입학학생은 4학기차에 소정의 변경기간에 변경신청가능 (문의 : 478-7899)</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 38.6pt; TEXT-INDENT: -38.6pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: 0.1pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;사. 기타 문의사항 : 478-7028(교무연구처 학사관리팀)<span style=\"HWP-TAB: 1\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 100%; TEXT-ALIGN: left\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;\"><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 100%; TEXT-ALIGN: left\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 15pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;\">2012. 01.&nbsp; 03.&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 15pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;\"><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 100%; TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 20pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 100%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;\">금오공과대학교총장</span></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
